    "",
    "HONESTY GAPS (mandatory, per §CONTEXT-DATA-HONESTY):",
    "  (1) The per-zone kleiner/grosser Grundabstand (Art.38) numeric table is UNKNOWN — left null with a",
    "      typed reason on every zone. It is NOT the single Art.13 Grundgrenzabstand (carried below where",
    "      the catalogue states it: W2bIII 5.0 m, Z5 3.5 m); it is the smaller/larger boundary-distance",
    "      pair that Art.38 defines and that has not yet been extracted from the scanned BZO ordinance.",
    "  (2) TWO PARALLEL REGIMES (bzo_91_99 vs bzo_2016) disagree on height (RISK R4): W2bIII = 8.5 m under",
