    "      emitted per (zone, regime) pair the catalogue actually carries — never a regime-merged number.",
    "  (3) confidence = 'estimated-ruleset' on every value: this is a PDF transcription, not a live",
    "      authoritative structured feed — never 'structured'. Ships to a rendered envelope only when the",
    "      repo owner flips CH_FAR_CERTIFIED (see ../../sources/VERIFICATION.md; the per-parcel Zürich BZO",
    "      sign-off line is still UNSIGNED — RISK R3).",
    "",
    "FRONT setback is Baulinie-driven (a GIS geometry, per parcel — resolved from the building-line layer,",
    "not a per-zone number). SIDE setback is the Grenzabstand (Art.38 formula + the unknown kleiner/grosser",
    "table). REAR is derived from the front/side envelope. Gebäudeabstand def = PBG §260 (see the sibling",
    "ch-zh-zurich-BZO-rules.json). Resolver order = ch-zh-zurich-LEGAL-HIERARCHY.md."
